{"seq":3,"slug":"apa-renew-adjust","title":"APA 续签与经营变化调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/apa-advance-arrangement/apa-renew-adjust","wordCount":1874,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"apa-续签与经营变化调整\">APA 续签与经营变化调整</h1><p>一份 APA 是有期限的。到期前要么续签、要么让保护自然失效并回到常规文档轨道，而这两条路的成本差别远小于&quot;到期后才发现没安排&quot;的代价。比到期更常见、也更麻烦的情况是经营在期内发生了变化——收购了一条新业务线、把制造环节外包出去、或者某产品的收入结构彻底改变。这些变化会触及关键假设，而处理方式决定了这份 APA 是继续提供保护，还是变成一份与事实脱节的文书。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-到期前的续签窗口\">核心概念：到期前的续签窗口</h2><p>续签不是在到期那天才启动的动作。续签本质上是<strong>一次基于新事实的重新申请</strong>，它需要重新建立财务数据窗口、重新评估方法是否仍然适用、并重新与税务机关（双边情形下是双方税务机关）确认。因此续签的准备期应与原始申请相当，通常在到期前一年以上启动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[APA 到期前 18 个月] --&gt; B[评估方法是否仍适用]&#10;  B --&gt; C{方法是否需要更换}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[更新可比样本与财务窗口]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[就新方法征求意见&lt;br/&gt;必要时前置会议]&#10;  D --&gt; F[提交续签申请]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[过渡期安排]&#10;  G --&gt; H{续签是否及时完成}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[保护无缝延续]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[需就缺口年度单独说明]\">graph TD\n  A[APA 到期前 18 个月] --&gt; B[评估方法是否仍适用]\n  B --&gt; C{方法是否需要更换}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[更新可比样本与财务窗口]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[就新方法征求意见&lt;br/&gt;必要时前置会议]\n  D --&gt; F[提交续签申请]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[过渡期安排]\n  G --&gt; H{续签是否及时完成}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[保护无缝延续]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[需就缺口年度单独说明]</pre><p>图上最需要提前处理的是过渡期。如果续签在到期后仍未完成，中间会出现若干无保护年度，这些年度需要按常规文档轨道准备，并在续签完成后补入覆盖范围（若税务机关接受）。哪些年度需要单独准备文档，取决于各辖区的申报义务门槛，判断方法见 <a href=\"../beps-three-tier-doc/contemporaneous-doc-prepare\">同期资料准备与年度关联申报</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"续签与重新申请的区别\">续签与重新申请的区别</h3><p>续签在程序上通常比原始申请简化——已有的事实基础与谈判历史可以复用，用户费也常适用不同费率。但<strong>程序简化不等于分析简化</strong>：功能风险资产可能在五到十年里变化很大，直接沿用旧结论是续签中最常见的错误。一家当初被认定为有限风险分销商的实体，如今可能已经建立了自己的本地渠道与品牌资产，继续按原结论申请会立刻在评估阶段受阻。美国规则把续签申请与原始申请同列为 APA 请求的形式之一，均需按规定的信息内容提交（<a href=\"https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-drop/rp-15-41.pdf\">Rev. Proc. 2015-41</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事项</th>\n<th>原始申请</th>\n<th>续签</th>\n<th>重新申请</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事实基础</td>\n<td>需完整建立</td>\n<td>可复用但须复核</td>\n<td>需完整重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方法评估</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>须重新评估适用性</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前置会议</td>\n<td>通常需要</td>\n<td>视变化幅度</td>\n<td>通常需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可比样本</td>\n<td>重新筛选</td>\n<td>更新窗口</td>\n<td>重新筛选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户费</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n<td>常适用不同费率</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"期内变化的分类与处理\">期内变化的分类与处理</h2><p>经营变化按对 APA 的影响程度可分三类，处理方式完全不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第一类-不触及关键假设的变化\">第一类：不触及关键假设的变化</h3><p>销量增长、产品价格调整、汇率波动等属于正常经营波动，不构成 APA 失效。处理方式是在年度报告中如实反映并说明其对结果的影响。这类变化无需通知税务机关，但需要在报告中留下痕迹。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第二类-触及关键假设但可量化调整\">第二类：触及关键假设但可量化调整</h3><p>例如产品结构发生变化，使原有可比样本的代表性下降，但方法与功能定性未变。这类变化的处理是重新筛选可比样本并更新区间，年度报告中说明样本更新及其理由。若更新后的结果落在新区间之外，触发真调整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第三类-动摇方法或功能定性的结构性变化\">第三类：动摇方法或功能定性的结构性变化</h3><p>这是最需要注意的一类。典型情形包括：新增业务线导致实体功能角色改变（从分销扩展到制造）、重大收购带来的无形资产并入、或业务模式从自营转向平台化。这类变化会使<strong>原 APA 的方法前提不再成立</strong>，继续按原方法计算与申报，等于用一份错误的分析支撑一个真实的调整结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"CHANGE_CLASSES = {&#10;    &quot;cosmetic&quot;: {&quot;notify&quot;: False, &quot;rescreen&quot;: False, &quot;renegotiate&quot;: False},&#10;    &quot;assumption_breach&quot;: {&quot;notify&quot;: True, &quot;rescreen&quot;: True, &quot;renegotiate&quot;: False},&#10;    &quot;structural&quot;: {&quot;notify&quot;: True, &quot;rescreen&quot;: True, &quot;renegotiate&quot;: True},&#10;}&#10;&#10;def classify_change(signals):&#10;    if signals.get(&quot;functional_role_changed&quot;):&#10;        return &quot;structural&quot;&#10;    if signals.get(&quot;concentration_out_of_band&quot;) or signals.get(&quot;new_intangible_acquired&quot;):&#10;        return &quot;assumption_breach&quot;&#10;    return &quot;cosmetic&quot;&#10;&#10;def required_actions(cls, apa):&#10;    rules = CHANGE_CLASSES[cls]&#10;    actions = []&#10;    if rules[&quot;notify&quot;]:&#10;        actions.append(&quot;notify competent authority within the term&#39;s notice window&quot;)&#10;    if rules[&quot;rescreen&quot;]:&#10;        actions.append(&quot;refresh comparables and re-test the range&quot;)&#10;    if rules[&quot;renegotiate&quot;]:&#10;        actions.append(&quot;request amendment or early renewal&quot;)&#10;    return actions\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CHANGE_CLASSES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"cosmetic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rescreen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"renegotiate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"assumption_breach\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rescreen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"renegotiate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"structural\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rescreen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"renegotiate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> classify_change</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(signals):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signals.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"functional_role_changed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"structural\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signals.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"concentration_out_of_band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signals.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new_intangible_acquired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"assumption_breach\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"cosmetic\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> required_actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cls, apa):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> CHANGE_CLASSES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rules[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        actions.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify competent authority within the term's notice window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rules[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rescreen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        actions.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refresh comparables and re-test the range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rules[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"renegotiate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        actions.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"request amendment or early renewal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actions</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段分类逻辑的价值在于<strong>把&quot;要不要通知税务机关&quot;这个容易拖延的判断，变成由事实信号触发的确定性动作</strong>。持续的结构性变化最容易出问题：企业往往先观察一两年，等到年度报告时才发现已经连续偏离，而此时已经错过了约定的通知窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"修订与终止的选择\">修订与终止的选择</h2><p>当结构性变化发生时，有三条路径：修订现有 APA 的覆盖范围、提前申请续签并采用新方法、或终止该 APA 并回到常规轨道。</p>\n<p>选择的关键判据是<strong>变化是否具有持续性</strong>。短期的、有望回归的偏离适合修订覆盖范围；已确定为新常态的变化适合提前续签；而如果变化大到连关联交易的基本形态都变了（例如该实体退出集团链条），终止反而是更干净的处理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 覆盖范围修订的影响测算：修订前后各覆盖年度的结果差异&#10;WITH coverage_before AS (&#10;  SELECT year, SUM(txn_amount) AS covered_amount, SUM(result) AS covered_result&#10;  FROM apa_covered_txn WHERE apa_id = &#39;APA-2027-001&#39; AND year &lt;= 2031&#10;  GROUP BY year&#10;),&#10;coverage_after AS (&#10;  SELECT year, SUM(txn_amount) AS covered_amount, SUM(result) AS covered_result&#10;  FROM apa_covered_txn&#10;  WHERE apa_id = &#39;APA-2027-001&#39; AND year &lt;= 2031&#10;    AND txn_type &lt;&gt; &#39;new_business_line&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY year&#10;)&#10;SELECT b.year, b.covered_amount - a.covered_amount AS excluded_amount,&#10;       b.covered_result - a.covered_result AS excluded_result&#10;FROM coverage_before b JOIN coverage_after a USING (year)&#10;ORDER BY b.year;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 覆盖范围修订的影响测算：修订前后各覆盖年度的结果差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coverage_before </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> year</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(txn_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> covered_amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> covered_result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apa_covered_txn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apa_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'APA-2027-001'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> year</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2031</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> year</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">coverage_after </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> year</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(txn_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> covered_amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> covered_result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apa_covered_txn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apa_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'APA-2027-001'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> year</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2031</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'new_business_line'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> year</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">year</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">covered_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">covered_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> excluded_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">covered_result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">covered_result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> excluded_result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coverage_before b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coverage_after a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">year</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">year</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>修订覆盖范围意味着被排除的部分回到常规轨道，需要单独的文档支撑。这张测算表的用途是评估排除后的管理负担——排除的金额越大，需要单独准备的分析就越多，有时修订的净收益是负的，此时提前续签更划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失效与历史年度\">失效与历史年度</h2><p>一个边界问题是：APA 终止或到期后，<strong>已经过去的覆盖年度是否仍然受保护</strong>。答案是肯定的——APA 通常按年度生效，已完成的覆盖年度不因后续终止而失效，前提是这些年度本身符合约定（年度报告已提交、方法已遵守）。反过来说，如果发现某覆盖年度实际未遵守约定，该年度可以被撤销适用，即便 APA 整体仍然有效。</p>\n<p>这个规则有两个实务含义。其一，<strong>终止 APA 并不能消除历史年度的遵从记录审查</strong>，因此在终止前应当先复核全部覆盖年度的遵从情况。其二，续签时税务机关会审查上一期的遵从记录，历史遵从瑕疵会直接影响续签谈判的起点。这解释了为什么执行期的年度报告纪律，其价值会在几年后的续签中体现出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>续签本质是基于新事实的重新申请，准备期应与原始申请相当，通常提前一年以上启动。</li>\n<li>程序简化不等于分析简化：功能风险资产在五到十年里变化很大，沿用旧结论是续签中最常见的错误。</li>\n<li>期内变化分三类：正常波动（报告反映）、触及假设可量化调整（重新筛选样本）、结构性变化（需通知并可能修订或提前续签）。</li>\n<li>&quot;要不要通知税务机关&quot;应由事实信号触发为确定性动作，拖延到年度报告时往往已错过约定的通知窗口。</li>\n<li>修订覆盖范围需评估排除部分的单独管理负担，净收益为负时提前续签更划算。</li>\n<li>已完成的覆盖年度不因 APA 后续终止而失效，但历史遵从瑕疵会在续签谈判中直接影响起点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"APA 续签与经营变化调整","id":"apa-续签与经营变化调整"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：到期前的续签窗口","id":"核心概念-到期前的续签窗口"},{"level":3,"text":"续签与重新申请的区别","id":"续签与重新申请的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"期内变化的分类与处理","id":"期内变化的分类与处理"},{"level":3,"text":"第一类：不触及关键假设的变化","id":"第一类-不触及关键假设的变化"},{"level":3,"text":"第二类：触及关键假设但可量化调整","id":"第二类-触及关键假设但可量化调整"},{"level":3,"text":"第三类：动摇方法或功能定性的结构性变化","id":"第三类-动摇方法或功能定性的结构性变化"},{"level":2,"text":"修订与终止的选择","id":"修订与终止的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"失效与历史年度","id":"失效与历史年度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"APA 谈判与执行遵从","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/apa-advance-arrangement/apa-negotiate-comply"},"next":{"title":"转让定价稽查调查应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/tax-audit-defense/tp-audit-investigation-response"}}